<title>ITALY: Alitalia, Telecom Italia seek synergies.</title>
<headline>Alitalia, Telecom Italia seek synergies.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian state airline Alitalia and telephone operator Telecom Italia SpA have signed a joint deal to seek out synergies between the two companies and develop services for clients, the firms said on Monday.</p>
<p>In particular, the agreement aimed at increasing tourist information about travel and hotel offers via the intranet, the companies said in a joint statement.</p>
<p>It said Alitalia's own telecommunications network would be used to the full. It gave o financial details.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
